1
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:47,820
[KING OF COMEDY]

2
00:01:48,340 --> 00:01:50,930
[Episode 21]

3
00:01:56,470 --> 00:01:57,430
Don't worry.

4
00:01:57,430 --> 00:01:59,470
Maybe he's not smart,
but he's always lucky.

5
00:01:59,470 --> 00:02:00,310
God bless him.

6
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,460
He'll definitely be fine.

7
00:02:04,310 --> 00:02:06,710
I'll go back
once I get time off from the crew.

8
00:02:06,710 --> 00:02:07,370
Wait for me.

9
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:12,520
Stop!

10
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,030
This is ridiculous!

11
00:02:19,030 --> 00:02:20,000
Exactly.

12
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,240
No way.

13
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:23,030
My friend is determined
to be the village chief.

14
00:02:23,030 --> 00:02:24,240
He wouldn't scam the villagers' money.

15
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:25,520
Something must be wrong.

16
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:27,320
I meant, are you messing with me?

17
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,750
You come and go as you please?

18
00:02:29,750 --> 00:02:32,000
Do you think this is a playground?

19
00:02:32,910 --> 00:02:33,440
No, miss.

20
00:02:33,590 --> 00:02:35,240
Things are a bit complicated.

21
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,170
I have to go back.

22
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:38,150
But I'll be quick and come back soon.

23
00:02:38,150 --> 00:02:38,960
How soon?

24
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:40,870
As soon as possible.

25
00:02:40,870 --> 00:02:42,190
How soon is that?

26
00:02:42,210 --> 00:02:43,120
Very soon.

27
00:02:43,150 --> 00:02:44,030
Cut the crap.

28
00:02:44,870 --> 00:02:45,750
Let me ask you.

29
00:02:45,870 --> 00:02:48,470
How much money
was this village scammed out of?

30
00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:50,840
Seems like over 2 million yuan.

31
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,360
Then do you know how much money

32
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,840
you can make from this project?

33
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,280
Miss, it's not like that.

34
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,280
Shut up.

35
00:02:57,430 --> 00:02:59,560
As an investor,

36
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,750
I'm telling you,

37
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:01,680
if you leave,

38
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:02,870
I'll replace you immediately!

39
00:03:02,870 --> 00:03:04,220
Whether you should stay or go,

40
00:03:04,220 --> 00:03:05,540
think it through.

41
00:03:06,210 --> 00:03:08,150
Are you really going to give up
such a good opportunity

42
00:03:08,150 --> 00:03:10,080
just for this village?

43
00:03:41,600 --> 00:03:45,390
[Scammer]

44
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,110
[Fraud]

45
00:03:55,430 --> 00:03:57,400
Zhen is back!

46
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,680
Zhen is back!

47
00:03:59,750 --> 00:04:01,750
Zhen is back!

48
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,360
What's going on?

49
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,910
Pay back the money!

50
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,080
Wait, calm down!

51
00:04:10,590 --> 00:04:11,390
What's wrong?

52
00:04:11,710 --> 00:04:12,640
What's going on?

53
00:04:14,590 --> 00:04:16,430
Stop!

54
00:04:16,950 --> 00:04:17,810
What happened?

55
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:18,829
Zhen.

56
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,190
I never imagined

57
00:04:20,190 --> 00:04:21,390
your brother could be like that!

58
00:04:21,390 --> 00:04:22,790
Do you want to make money?

59
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,310
Do you want to get rich?

60
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:26,040
Just follow my lead,

61
00:04:26,190 --> 00:04:29,070
and you'll be
the richest people in the world!

62
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,070
Impossible!

63
00:04:30,070 --> 00:04:31,720
How could my brother act like that?

64
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:32,720
But he did!

65
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:33,950
What did he do?

66
00:04:33,950 --> 00:04:36,120
Last time, he gathered us together...

67
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:39,270
Then he...

68
00:04:39,630 --> 00:04:40,690
Fellow villagers,

69
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,390
I gathered everyone here today

70
00:04:42,390 --> 00:04:44,360
to announce a piece of good news!

71
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,390
What is it?

72
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:48,000
Stephen Chow, the international superstar,

73
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,930
is preparing to make his new movie.

74
00:04:49,950 --> 00:04:52,720
And I was very lucky

75
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:54,040
to meet his agent.

76
00:04:54,510 --> 00:04:55,750
I managed to get a small investment share

77
00:04:55,750 --> 00:04:58,950
for all of you.

78
00:05:00,070 --> 00:05:01,510
If there's anyone in this world

79
00:05:01,510 --> 00:05:03,910
whose movies are guaranteed to make money,

80
00:05:04,110 --> 00:05:06,070
I think it has to be Stephen Chow!

81
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:07,870
I think

82
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:10,920
for all the villagers in Shapu Village,

83
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,480
this is like a massive fortune

84
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:14,310
falling right into us!

85
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,870
Jiahao, which Mr. Chow?

86
00:05:15,870 --> 00:05:17,160
Exactly.

87
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:20,280
You don't believe me, right?

88
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,160
Look,

89
00:05:21,540 --> 00:05:24,130
this is the card of Stephen Chow's agent,

90
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:26,060
with all their information on it.

91
00:05:26,190 --> 00:05:28,800
You can all look it up online.

92
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:31,390
Besides, if I hadn't verified it,

93
00:05:31,390 --> 00:05:32,680
would I tell you?

94
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,950
Please trust me.

95
00:05:34,070 --> 00:05:36,040
I would never harm you.

96
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:38,600
I only want you to make more money!

97
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,750
As you know,

98
00:05:41,750 --> 00:05:44,480
Stephen Chow is
an international superstar.

99
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:45,830
Whenever he makes a movie,

100
00:05:45,830 --> 00:05:48,870
so many rich people bring money to him,

101
00:05:48,870 --> 00:05:50,150
but he won't even see them.

102
00:05:50,150 --> 00:05:52,270
But this time, he wants to shoot his movie

103
00:05:52,270 --> 00:05:54,400
in Shapu Village,

104
00:05:54,430 --> 00:05:56,360
so we have the chance to invest.

105
00:05:56,390 --> 00:05:57,150
I think

106
00:05:57,150 --> 00:05:58,430
there are two benefits.

107
00:05:58,430 --> 00:06:01,240
First, you can make some money

108
00:06:01,830 --> 00:06:03,270
to improve your lives

109
00:06:03,270 --> 00:06:04,560
and cover your daily expenses.

110
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:07,480
Second, once the movie is released,

111
00:06:07,630 --> 00:06:09,560
we will no longer be just villagers,

112
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:11,360
but shareholders of this movie.

113
00:06:11,430 --> 00:06:13,440
This will make a huge difference

114
00:06:13,470 --> 00:06:15,270
to the promotion of our village!

115
00:06:18,950 --> 00:06:20,280
I'll invest 3,500 yuan!

116
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,360
I'll invest 3,500 yuan!

117
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,090
Anyone else?

118
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:23,720
2,800 yuan!

119
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:26,130
3,500 yuan!

120
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,040
2,000 yuan!

121
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,500
-3,500 yuan!
-8,000 yuan!

122
00:06:31,310 --> 00:06:32,310
Don't rush!

123
00:06:32,310 --> 00:06:33,240
So rich.

124
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,120
2,000 yuan!

125
00:06:34,430 --> 00:06:36,680
3,500 yuan!

126
00:06:37,150 --> 00:06:38,430
Line up!

127
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:39,720
One at a time!

128
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:40,920
Everyone in the village knows about this,

129
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,409
yet you're still saying
he's a good person.

130
00:06:42,409 --> 00:06:43,050
Exactly.

131
00:06:44,070 --> 00:06:45,930
Is there some misunderstanding?

132
00:06:46,270 --> 00:06:46,920
Listen to me, everyone!

133
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,360
Is there some misunderstanding?

134
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:50,040
Jiahao isn't that kind of person!

135
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,270
Everyone, listen to me!

136
00:06:51,270 --> 00:06:52,070
My brother...

137
00:06:52,190 --> 00:06:53,600
Don't you know him?

138
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:55,430
Fellow villagers!

139
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,450
I believe Jiahao!

140
00:06:56,450 --> 00:06:57,110
Mr. Zhou...

141
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:58,040
Mr. Zhou?

142
00:06:58,510 --> 00:06:59,070
Mr. Zhou?

143
00:06:59,270 --> 00:07:00,200
Mr. Zhou is here.

144
00:07:02,820 --> 00:07:04,350
How did you get here so fast?

145
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:05,750
Calm down.

146
00:07:05,750 --> 00:07:06,360
Calm down.

147
00:07:07,830 --> 00:07:09,360
How did you get back so fast?

148
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,780
I took a taxi back overnight.

149
00:07:10,780 --> 00:07:11,800
So expensive.

150
00:07:12,190 --> 00:07:12,790
It's fine.

151
00:07:14,310 --> 00:07:15,640
Everyone, listen to me.

152
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,920
Okay! Alright!

153
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,070
Stop! Alright!

154
00:07:22,070 --> 00:07:24,120
Calm down! Calm down!

155
00:07:24,140 --> 00:07:25,470
What exactly happened?

156
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,950
Here's the thing.

157
00:07:28,310 --> 00:07:29,600
What's going on?

158
00:07:29,830 --> 00:07:32,150
Why hasn't the movie started shooting yet?

159
00:07:32,150 --> 00:07:34,360
Sir, don't worry.

160
00:07:34,850 --> 00:07:35,800
Just be patient.

161
00:07:35,830 --> 00:07:37,830
You didn't invest any money, right?

162
00:07:38,630 --> 00:07:39,870
I didn't.

163
00:07:39,870 --> 00:07:40,630
Good then.

164
00:07:41,430 --> 00:07:42,830
Are you serious, Junnan?

165
00:07:43,190 --> 00:07:44,240
Didn't you invest 20,000 yuan?

166
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:46,040
3,000 yuan for each of us, right?

167
00:07:46,310 --> 00:07:47,800
Wasn't it 5,000 yuan each?

168
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:49,040
Why are you so...

169
00:07:49,270 --> 00:07:51,040
Why did you tell me it was 5,000?

170
00:07:51,150 --> 00:07:52,000
Calm down!

171
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,390
Sir, this... I...

172
00:07:54,270 --> 00:07:55,950
I just invested a little.

173
00:07:56,390 --> 00:07:57,360
Don't tell Ximei.

174
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:59,430
Don't tell Ximei?

175
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,600
You can't invest!

176
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:03,390
You'll lose money!

177
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:05,310
Sir, the movie industry

178
00:08:05,630 --> 00:08:06,760
is too complicated.

179
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,450
Here's a piece of good news.

180
00:08:08,830 --> 00:08:10,630
We're seeing a return on our investment!

181
00:08:10,630 --> 00:08:11,600
Come and get it!

182
00:08:13,390 --> 00:08:14,920
How did you even make money?

183
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:15,750
Well,

184
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:18,830
we're "overflowing with fortune."

185
00:08:22,950 --> 00:08:24,010
Fellow villagers,

186
00:08:24,750 --> 00:08:25,950
like I said,

187
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:27,430
I, Chen Jiahao,

188
00:08:27,510 --> 00:08:30,510
would never let down anyone who trusts me.

189
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:32,270
Today, I'm here to tell you

190
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,669
that although the movie
hasn't started shooting,

191
00:08:34,669 --> 00:08:35,669
a boss heard

192
00:08:35,669 --> 00:08:37,750
it's directed
by Mr. Stephen Chow

193
00:08:37,940 --> 00:08:40,070
and decided to pay an advertising fee.

194
00:08:40,270 --> 00:08:41,320
So, I thought,

195
00:08:41,909 --> 00:08:43,440
according to the contract,

196
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:45,670
shouldn't we also have a share?

197
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,550
That's right!

198
00:08:47,550 --> 00:08:49,870
So, here's the thing.

199
00:08:49,870 --> 00:08:51,670
Anyone who invested

200
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:53,510
can get money today!

201
00:08:53,510 --> 00:08:55,200
Great!

202
00:08:55,510 --> 00:08:56,960
Stand where you are.

203
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,000
When I call your name,

204
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:58,910
come and get the money.

205
00:08:58,910 --> 00:09:00,360
Okay!

206
00:09:00,670 --> 00:09:01,510
Qingxia,

207
00:09:01,630 --> 00:09:02,600
400 yuan!

208
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,080
Yang Chaoyue,

209
00:09:06,390 --> 00:09:07,390
350 yuan!

210
00:09:11,750 --> 00:09:12,750
Smarty,

211
00:09:13,030 --> 00:09:14,120
250 yuan!

212
00:09:15,030 --> 00:09:15,840
15 yuan...

213
00:09:16,510 --> 00:09:17,960
Jiahao, 250 for me!

214
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,080
250 for me!

215
00:09:19,790 --> 00:09:21,270
Weren't you at the gathering last time?

216
00:09:21,270 --> 00:09:22,530
Why didn't you invest?

217
00:09:22,670 --> 00:09:24,500
Didn't you tell me not to waste money?

218
00:09:24,500 --> 00:09:26,020
Is this a waste of money?

219
00:09:26,270 --> 00:09:28,030
You never spend money in the right place!

220
00:09:28,030 --> 00:09:30,240
I wish I'd never married you!

221
00:09:30,630 --> 00:09:32,490
Then I'll waste money from now on.

222
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:33,520
I'll waste money!

223
00:09:33,630 --> 00:09:34,670
Don't you dare!

224
00:09:34,670 --> 00:09:36,000
You can't waste money!

225
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:38,360
Then should I waste money

226
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,360
or not?

227
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,240
Cut the crap!

228
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:41,200
Hurry up and find Jiahao

229
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,360
to see if we can still invest!

230
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,480
Are you here to fulfill a vow?

231
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:45,960
Yes! The more I invest, the more I earn.

232
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,150
I've made my money back.

233
00:09:47,150 --> 00:09:48,480
When I invested 300 yuan,

234
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,870
you asked me not to invest much.

235
00:09:49,870 --> 00:09:51,120
I should've invested 5,000 yuan!

236
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,380
I invested too little!

237
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:53,790
I invested too little.

238
00:09:53,790 --> 00:09:54,870
Look at Cao Wei.

239
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:57,120
He already earned 500 yuan,
double the amount he paid.

240
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,200
You invested so much.

241
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,360
-You must've made a fortune.
-Exactly.

242
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:00,440
How much did you invest?

243
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:01,510
I invested 5,000 yuan,

244
00:10:01,510 --> 00:10:02,360
and the return is already this high.

245
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,870
What if I invested 50,000 yuan?

246
00:10:03,870 --> 00:10:05,080
If I knew the return was so high,

247
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,540
I would've invested more.

248
00:10:07,390 --> 00:10:09,850
Cao Wei borrowed the money
from me to invest!

249
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:11,270
Cao Wei! Cao Wei, pay me back!

250
00:10:11,270 --> 00:10:12,100
I also want to invest!

251
00:10:12,100 --> 00:10:13,840
-How can you get 50,000 yuan?
-Exactly.

252
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:14,480
Tell me,

253
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,670
isn't my boat worth 50,000 yuan?

254
00:10:16,670 --> 00:10:18,320
Who else can lend me money?

255
00:10:18,390 --> 00:10:20,120
Is it too late to make a wish now?

256
00:10:20,870 --> 00:10:22,200
Who cares if it's too late?

257
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:22,960
Let's go make a wish.

258
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:23,960
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

259
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:24,480
Let's go!

260
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:25,140
Make a wish.

261
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,150
Listen to me!

262
00:10:31,630 --> 00:10:33,270
This sounds fishy right from the start.

263
00:10:33,270 --> 00:10:34,200
It must be a scam.

264
00:10:34,510 --> 00:10:35,870
What kind of movie would pay dividends

265
00:10:35,870 --> 00:10:36,750
before it even starts shooting?

266
00:10:36,750 --> 00:10:37,480
Exactly!

267
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:41,600
Okay, what happened next?

268
00:10:45,270 --> 00:10:47,470
Now you know what I'm capable of, right?

269
00:10:47,870 --> 00:10:48,480
Jiahao!

270
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,790
Jiahao, you called us here again.

271
00:10:50,790 --> 00:10:51,910
Is there any good news?

272
00:10:51,910 --> 00:10:52,750
That's right.

273
00:10:52,750 --> 00:10:54,440
You're too close. I can't breathe.

274
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:55,670
Step back. Step back.

275
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,030
Stand properly!

276
00:10:59,390 --> 00:11:00,670
Stand properly!

277
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:02,390
Stand properly!

278
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,840
Stand properly!

279
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:04,910
Many people

280
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,480
have come to me,

281
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:08,610
saying they missed the first investment

282
00:11:08,610 --> 00:11:09,910
and asking if there's still a chance.

283
00:11:09,910 --> 00:11:10,630
Some people

284
00:11:10,910 --> 00:11:13,030
wanted to invest more,

285
00:11:13,050 --> 00:11:14,710
asking me if there's a chance.

286
00:11:15,060 --> 00:11:15,780
You're all

287
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:18,000
troublemakers, aren't you?

288
00:11:19,670 --> 00:11:20,800
What else could I do?

289
00:11:21,030 --> 00:11:23,390
I had to swallow my pride and beg them.

290
00:11:24,550 --> 00:11:25,350
Fortunately,

291
00:11:25,670 --> 00:11:27,040
