292
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:29,670
and released another two percent share.

293
00:11:30,030 --> 00:11:31,760
It's 1.5 million yuan in total!

294
00:11:32,630 --> 00:11:34,390
But I'll make this clear.

295
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:35,850
We must complete it.

296
00:11:36,150 --> 00:11:37,080
Can you do it?

297
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,510
We can!

298
00:11:40,750 --> 00:11:42,150
Complete it!

299
00:11:42,150 --> 00:11:43,600
Did you invest more?

300
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:44,360
Yes, we did!

301
00:11:44,550 --> 00:11:46,630
My dad invested all his pension!

302
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:48,150
Give it to me!

303
00:11:48,150 --> 00:11:49,480
Give it to me!

304
00:11:50,630 --> 00:11:51,240
Jiajia,

305
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,240
give it to me!

306
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:53,630
Dad, making a little profit is enough.

307
00:11:53,630 --> 00:11:55,080
This is your pension!

308
00:11:55,550 --> 00:11:56,360
Jiajia!

309
00:11:56,510 --> 00:11:58,390
Do you know how many scammers there are

310
00:11:58,390 --> 00:12:00,320
and how many elderly people
have been scammed?

311
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,200
Please stop!

312
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:02,630
Making a little profit is enough!

313
00:12:02,630 --> 00:12:03,360
Give it to me!

314
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:05,910
Fine.

315
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:07,540
I'll listen to you.

316
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:09,440
You've stayed in the city for a long time,

317
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:10,240
and you've seen more.

318
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:12,240
I'll listen to you.
I won't invest anymore.

319
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:12,980
Well, Jiajia,

320
00:12:12,980 --> 00:12:14,600
can you help me take this inside?

321
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:14,930
Okay.

322
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,840
Where are you going, Dad?

323
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:20,550
Done.

324
00:12:20,550 --> 00:12:21,120
Let me see.

325
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:21,720
Look.

326
00:12:23,170 --> 00:12:23,800
No problem.

327
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:24,440
Here, sir.

328
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:25,550
Okay.

329
00:12:25,630 --> 00:12:26,600
I'll transfer the money

330
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:27,600
to you tonight.

331
00:12:27,670 --> 00:12:28,360
Okay!

332
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,580
Next time you need money, just tell me.

333
00:12:29,580 --> 00:12:30,310
Definitely!

334
00:12:30,670 --> 00:12:33,120
I'm making money! I'm getting rich!

335
00:12:36,030 --> 00:12:36,720
Who's that?

336
00:12:37,080 --> 00:12:38,680
Didn't you say I was useless?

337
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:41,480
I just sold

338
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:42,030
