339
00:12:42,030 --> 00:12:43,390
We can make a movie now!

340
00:12:43,910 --> 00:12:45,480
Really? We can make a movie?

341
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:46,130
Yes!

342
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:47,390
How much did you sell it for?

343
00:12:47,390 --> 00:12:49,000
150,000 yuan!

344
00:12:49,150 --> 00:12:49,840
150,000 yuan?

345
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:50,510
Yes.

346
00:12:50,530 --> 00:12:52,320
We only bought it for 100,000 yuan.

347
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:53,440
Well done!

348
00:12:53,630 --> 00:12:54,930
Give it to me. Let me see.

349
00:12:54,930 --> 00:12:56,330
We're getting rich!

350
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:57,750
One, ten, hundred...

351
00:12:58,720 --> 00:13:01,320
You sold it for 15,000 yuan?

352
00:13:01,340 --> 00:13:02,870
Can you even count?

353
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:04,750
Hello, Mr. Zhang.

354
00:13:04,790 --> 00:13:06,080
This is Manyu.

355
00:13:06,150 --> 00:13:08,050
I can mortgage my house.

356
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:09,750
Your house is rented.

357
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:12,120
Can't I mortgage a rented house?

358
00:13:12,140 --> 00:13:13,780
These three machines

359
00:13:14,040 --> 00:13:15,240
are antiques,

360
00:13:15,260 --> 00:13:16,080
passed down from our ancestors.

361
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:17,390
They're from the Qing Dynasty.

362
00:13:17,390 --> 00:13:18,870
Did sewing machines even exist
in the Qing Dynasty?

363
00:13:18,870 --> 00:13:19,270
How would I know?

364
00:13:19,270 --> 00:13:19,870
Don't try to fool me.

365
00:13:19,870 --> 00:13:21,320
These are from 2014.

366
00:13:21,510 --> 00:13:22,960
2,000 yuan is a lot.

367
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:24,090
Hurry up and sign it.

368
00:13:25,790 --> 00:13:27,630
Mine is from the Ming Dynasty!

369
00:13:27,630 --> 00:13:28,440
A teapot from the Ming Dynasty!

370
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,630
From the Ming Dynasty...

371
00:13:29,630 --> 00:13:30,320
No need.

372
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:33,140
