373
00:13:39,280 --> 00:13:40,130
Okay.

374
00:13:40,690 --> 00:13:41,950
Did Jiahao invest too?

375
00:13:42,080 --> 00:13:42,750
No way.

376
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:44,000
He doesn't have any money.

377
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,130
I keep all the money.

378
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:46,270
Zhen!

379
00:13:46,590 --> 00:13:49,050
Your brother mortgaged
the welfare center!

380
00:13:49,910 --> 00:13:51,910
My brother mortgaged the welfare center?

381
00:13:51,910 --> 00:13:52,480
Yes!

382
00:13:53,390 --> 00:13:55,150
