384
00:13:56,690 --> 00:13:57,360
Exactly!

385
00:14:01,030 --> 00:14:02,550
Please calm down!

386
00:14:02,550 --> 00:14:03,120
Alright. Alright.

387
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:04,320
Even if he's like that,

388
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,240
