And...

394
00:14:17,030 --> 00:14:18,910
Wave the small flags!

395
00:14:18,910 --> 00:14:19,550
Wave the flags!

396
00:14:19,550 --> 00:14:20,750
Good! Excellent!

397
00:14:21,750 --> 00:14:22,790
Don't stand together!

398
00:14:22,790 --> 00:14:23,820
Here, stand over here!

399
00:14:23,820 --> 00:14:26,660
[Master Chow, Welcome to Shapu]

400
00:14:23,910 --> 00:14:25,030
One on each side!

401
00:14:25,030 --> 00:14:25,780
Good!

402
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:27,790
Step back! Step back!

403
00:14:27,790 --> 00:14:28,270
Show the

404
00:14:28,390 --> 00:14:30,000
English letters of Shapu.

405
00:14:39,510 --> 00:14:41,040
Fellow villagers of Shapu,

406
00:14:41,680 --> 00:14:44,400
today is definitely the most important day

407
00:14:44,750 --> 00:14:46,600
