413
00:14:56,670 --> 00:14:58,510
Ready, go!

414
00:14:58,750 --> 00:15:00,910
Master Chow, Master Chow,

415
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:02,750
humorous and funny.

416
00:15:02,750 --> 00:15:04,600
Joyful Shapu Village,

417
00:15:05,150 --> 00:15:06,960
waiting for you!

418
00:15:10,150 --> 00:15:11,610
Master Chow, Master Chow,

419
00:15:11,910 --> 00:15:13,510
humorous and funny.

420
00:15:13,670 --> 00:15:15,240
Joyful Shapu Village,

421
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:17,270
waiting for you!

422
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:18,900
Master Chow, Master Chow,

423
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:20,790
humorous and funny.

424
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:24,080
Joyful Shapu Village,

425
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:25,870
waiting for you!

426
