453
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:42,200
Who? Which Chris?

454
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:43,320
Chris, well...

455
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:45,320
The one who stayed in your big suite,

456
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:46,520
Master Chow's agent!

457
00:16:46,750 --> 00:16:48,750
Master Chow? What are you talking about?

458
00:16:48,750 --> 00:16:50,880
Master Chow! Who else could it be?

459
00:16:50,910 --> 00:16:51,670
Just Master Chow!

460
00:16:51,670 --> 00:16:52,630
That Master Chow!

461
00:16:52,630 --> 00:16:53,510
