474
00:17:09,440 --> 00:17:12,030
He signed the contract here
a couple of days ago!

475
00:17:12,030 --> 00:17:12,920
Signed it here?

476
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:13,720
-Yes.
-Yes.

477
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:14,400
I see.

478
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:15,720
Then we're responsible?

479
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:16,510
Of course!

480
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:17,859
Zhang, Wan.

481
00:17:19,180 --> 00:17:20,140
He knows...

482
00:17:20,270 --> 00:17:21,530
Come on, throw him out.

483
00:17:24,240 --> 00:17:25,200
I'm a victim!

484
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:28,160
Did you find him, Jiahao?

485
00:17:28,160 --> 00:17:29,360
Get off me! Get off me!

486
00:17:30,270 --> 00:17:31,800
Mr. Shark, what's going on?

487
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:34,400
Don't mention it! He ran away!

488
00:17:34,790 --> 00:17:36,160
Don't let him get away! Liar!

489
00:17:36,160 --> 00:17:36,720
Stop him!

490
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:37,640
