491
00:17:38,120 --> 00:17:39,180
What are you doing?

492
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:41,510
You scammed us out of our money!

493
00:17:41,510 --> 00:17:42,440
I scammed you?

494
00:17:42,590 --> 00:17:43,960
I invested too!

495
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:45,160
My money is also gone!

496
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:48,270
That's right!

497
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:55,880
Alright! Alright!

498
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:56,920
Listen to me! Listen to me!

499
00:17:56,920 --> 00:17:58,030
Listen to me! Listen to me!

500
00:17:58,030 --> 00:17:58,680
Everyone, listen to me!

501
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:00,240
Calm down! Calm down!

502
00:18:01,370 --> 00:18:02,130
Listen to me!

503
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:03,000
First,

504
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:04,880
