506
00:18:06,030 --> 00:18:07,000
And you must know

507
00:18:07,030 --> 00:18:08,880
that Jiahao is not that kind of person.

508
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:09,400
Second,

509
00:18:10,220 --> 00:18:11,420
he's not smart enough

510
00:18:12,590 --> 00:18:14,030
to come up with that.

511
00:18:14,370 --> 00:18:15,640
He doesn't have the IQ!

512
00:18:16,420 --> 00:18:17,010
Right?

513
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:19,010
Makes sense, right?

514
00:18:19,270 --> 00:18:21,200
Okay, the priority right now

515
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:22,240
is to figure out

516
00:18:22,260 --> 00:18:23,450
where Chris,

517
00:18:23,480 --> 00:18:24,480
the fake agent,

518
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:26,480
and the fake Master Chow are, right?

519
00:18:26,640 --> 00:18:27,590
Calm down!

520
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:30,640
Jiahao is back!

521
00:18:32,010 --> 00:18:33,140
He's at the pier!

522
00:18:33,490 --> 00:18:35,210
Jiahao is back!

523
00:18:35,240 --> 00:18:36,690
Let's go find him!

524
00:18:38,350 --> 00:18:39,440
Don't yell!

525
00:18:41,310 --> 00:18:43,310
Be quiet! Be quiet!

526
00:18:43,830 --> 00:18:44,640
Stop yelling!

527
00:18:45,030 --> 00:18:46,160
Stop yelling!

528
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:47,750
Calm down!

529
00:18:51,550 --> 00:18:52,310
Officer,

530
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:54,400
