-You're his family?
-Yes.

532
00:18:56,550 --> 00:18:58,200
Everyone, listen to me!

533
00:18:58,790 --> 00:18:59,590
Be quiet!

534
00:18:59,780 --> 00:19:01,240
I invested money too! Stop yelling!

535
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:02,400
Who invested more than I did?

536
00:19:02,400 --> 00:19:03,110
Anyone?

537
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:04,240
Okay.

538
00:19:04,480 --> 00:19:05,750
After investigation

539
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:07,520
and retrieving surveillance footage,

540
00:19:07,520 --> 00:19:08,240
we confirmed

541
00:19:08,240 --> 00:19:10,440
that someone did impersonate
Stephen Chow's agent

542
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:11,380
