546
00:19:18,680 --> 00:19:19,880
Did you hear that?

547
00:19:19,900 --> 00:19:20,680
Did you hear that?

548
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:21,280
Calm down!

549
00:19:23,030 --> 00:19:23,630
Calm down!

550
00:19:23,880 --> 00:19:25,110
Calm down! Listen to the police!

551
00:19:25,110 --> 00:19:27,110
Calm down! Listen to me!

552
00:19:28,300 --> 00:19:30,640
Just like you, Chen Jiahao

553
00:19:31,110 --> 00:19:32,590
