as soon as possible!

557
00:19:39,270 --> 00:19:40,510
Please trust us!

558
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:41,410
Okay?

559
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:43,960
Here, take him back. Go.

560
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:46,810
Brother, let's go home.

561
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:49,210
Be careful! Be careful!

562
00:19:49,450 --> 00:19:50,210
