563
00:19:58,680 --> 00:19:59,270
Go!

564
00:19:59,640 --> 00:20:00,240
Go!

565
00:20:01,030 --> 00:20:01,590
Ximei!

566
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:02,440
Ximei!

567
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:03,270
Ximei!

568
00:20:03,270 --> 00:20:04,240
Chen Junnan!

569
