I was only away for a while,

583
00:20:36,240 --> 00:20:37,960
and you made a huge mess!

584
00:20:37,980 --> 00:20:39,330
Even god can't fix it!

585
00:20:39,720 --> 00:20:40,960
How did you manage to do that?

586
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:42,920
Look at you! So impressive!

587
00:20:42,940 --> 00:20:44,110
You screwed over

588
00:20:44,110 --> 00:20:46,110
our entire village all by yourself!

589
00:20:46,550 --> 00:20:47,350
Those uncles and aunties

590
00:20:47,350 --> 00:20:48,240
watched us grow up.

591
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:49,000
How could you do that?

592
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:49,590
What's wrong with you?

593
00:20:49,590 --> 00:20:50,780
Why would you do that?

594
00:20:50,780 --> 00:20:51,720
You're a grown man!

595
00:20:51,720 --> 00:20:53,780
How could you do something like that?

596
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:54,590
Didn't I tell you?

597
00:20:54,590 --> 00:20:55,070
Didn't I tell you

598
00:20:55,070 --> 00:20:56,640
to be smart?

599
00:20:56,640 --> 00:20:57,440
Where is your brain?

600
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:59,170
-Enough.
-Where is your brain?

601
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:00,000
Zhen.

602
00:21:00,110 --> 00:21:02,000
You didn't take my words seriously at all,

603
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:02,590
did you?

604
00:21:02,590 --> 00:21:03,070
Zhen...

605
00:21:03,070 --> 00:21:04,350
-Zhen...
-Zhen...

606
00:21:04,350 --> 00:21:05,700
Now the welfare center is gone!

607
00:21:05,700 --> 00:21:06,660
-It's alright.
-Zhen!

608
00:21:06,660 --> 00:21:08,270
I told the people downstairs to go back.

609
00:21:08,270 --> 00:21:09,200
Give him a break.

610
00:21:10,070 --> 00:21:11,670
It's fine. Let him calm down.

611
00:21:11,990 --> 00:21:13,360
Jiahao is also pitiful.

612
00:21:16,510 --> 00:21:18,030
What's done is done.

613
00:21:18,890 --> 00:21:20,610
Let's talk about Chen Junnan.

614
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:21,200
Right...

615
00:21:22,740 --> 00:21:24,140
You invested too, right?

616
00:21:27,240 --> 00:21:29,310
I... I didn't invest much.

617
00:21:29,310 --> 00:21:30,640
Just a little.

618
00:21:31,200 --> 00:21:32,480
How much is "a little"?

619
00:21:33,660 --> 00:21:34,690
Well, I...

620
00:21:34,770 --> 00:21:35,790
I just put Junnan Mall up

621
00:21:35,790 --> 00:21:36,270
for a mortgage.

622
00:21:36,270 --> 00:21:37,400
The second floor is still there.

623
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:38,030
I still have a place

624
00:21:38,030 --> 00:21:39,110
to sleep, Ximei.

625
00:21:39,640 --> 00:21:40,310
Don't worry.

626
00:21:40,310 --> 00:21:41,550
You can fall asleep?

627
00:21:41,680 --> 00:21:43,030
What were you thinking?

628
00:21:44,110 --> 00:21:45,570
Well, at least I still have

629
00:21:46,160 --> 00:21:47,310
my dad...

630
00:21:48,170 --> 00:21:50,720
I can live off my dad or...

631
00:21:50,750 --> 00:21:52,880
Have you no shame? Live off your dad?

632
00:21:53,350 --> 00:21:54,640
How could you say that?

633
00:21:54,750 --> 00:21:55,940
What's wrong with you?

634
00:21:55,940 --> 00:21:56,940
Alright, Ximei.

635
00:21:57,070 --> 00:21:58,590
Well, it has happened.

636
00:21:58,590 --> 00:21:59,520
We shouldn't...

637
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:04,040
Let's try to figure this out.

638
00:22:04,110 --> 00:22:04,920
Tell us,

639
00:22:05,110 --> 00:22:07,480
what exactly happened?

640
00:22:07,970 --> 00:22:08,830
Take your time.

641
00:22:13,590 --> 00:22:14,160
Well...

642
00:22:17,680 --> 00:22:18,720
That day...

643
00:22:37,070 --> 00:22:39,400
You didn't go to
Jiahao's presentation either?

644
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:40,240
Why go there?

645
00:22:40,240 --> 00:22:41,110
No free eggs.

646
00:22:41,410 --> 00:22:42,270
Even if there were,

647
00:22:42,270 --> 00:22:43,720
I wouldn't take them.

648
00:22:43,740 --> 00:22:46,000
We're not going to vote for him after all.

649
00:22:46,030 --> 00:22:46,880
Jiahao

650
00:22:47,070 --> 00:22:48,440
is a good kid in every way,

651
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:49,640
but he's too stupid.

652
00:22:49,920 --> 00:22:51,120
Without Zhen around,

653
00:22:51,240 --> 00:22:52,840
what can he even accomplish?

654
00:22:53,310 --> 00:22:54,270
That's true.

655
00:22:54,960 --> 00:22:55,790
Where's Zhen?

656
00:22:55,790 --> 00:22:56,790
Have you seen her?

657
00:22:56,860 --> 00:22:58,320
Haven't seen her for days.

658
00:23:31,670 --> 00:23:32,920
I'm sorry...

659
00:23:33,930 --> 00:23:34,690
I'm sorry...

660
00:23:34,720 --> 00:23:37,000
I know! I know!

661
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:38,070
I'm sorry...

662
00:23:38,070 --> 00:23:39,590
No need!

663
00:23:39,590 --> 00:23:42,240
I'm sorry.

664
00:23:43,270 --> 00:23:45,790
You don't know.

665
00:23:46,310 --> 00:23:48,170
-I don't want to hear this.
-When Zhen...

666
00:23:48,170 --> 00:23:50,890
confessed to Zhou Ke...

667
00:23:51,170 --> 00:23:54,130
I saw them confessing
their feelings that day.

668
00:23:56,730 --> 00:23:58,900
Zhou Ke, Zhen.

669
00:24:00,310 --> 00:24:02,750
Why didn't she tell me anything?

670
00:24:03,310 --> 00:24:06,720
I was possessed by a devil!

671
00:24:07,030 --> 00:24:09,030
I let them down!

672
00:24:09,670 --> 00:24:12,880
When I saw that knife, I just...

673
00:24:13,400 --> 00:24:14,480
Stop repeating...

674
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:16,920
Stop repeating the same thing!

675
00:24:16,920 --> 00:24:18,160
I forgive you, okay?

676
00:24:19,960 --> 00:24:21,240
I'm sorry...

677
00:24:24,550 --> 00:24:25,680
When they come back,

678
00:24:26,110 --> 00:24:28,510
I'll apologize to them properly.

679
00:24:29,750 --> 00:24:31,480
Jiahao, please help me!

680
00:24:31,880 --> 00:24:33,240
Fine. Don't worry.

681
00:24:33,790 --> 00:24:35,830
When they come back,

682
00:24:35,830 --> 00:24:36,830
I-I'll...

683
00:24:36,830 --> 00:24:38,240
I'll talk to them, okay?

684
00:24:38,440 --> 00:24:40,960
I-I'll be the middleman.

685
00:24:42,560 --> 00:24:43,840
Thanks to both of them.

686
00:24:46,080 --> 00:24:47,710
I've found true love.

687
00:24:50,660 --> 00:24:51,590
Needless to say,

688
00:24:52,110 --> 00:24:53,000
I know who it is.

689
00:24:54,880 --> 00:24:56,110
Is it that...

690
00:24:56,830 --> 00:24:57,830
female director?

691
00:25:02,480 --> 00:25:03,830
I knew it right away.

692
00:25:06,680 --> 00:25:09,310
You and...

693
00:25:10,480 --> 00:25:11,240
Fang Hua.

694
00:25:11,790 --> 00:25:12,680
Fang Hua,

695
00:25:13,030 --> 00:25:13,750
right?

696
00:25:14,640 --> 00:25:15,480
We...

697
00:25:15,640 --> 00:25:16,440
Right?

698
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:18,030
We haven't made much progress.

699
00:25:18,030 --> 00:25:19,000
She was the reason

700
00:25:19,000 --> 00:25:20,860
you wanted to be the chief, right?

701
00:25:23,340 --> 00:25:25,010
Yes, partly.

702
00:25:26,480 --> 00:25:28,110
Well, she...

703
00:25:28,400 --> 00:25:29,640
she's a great girl.

704
00:25:29,670 --> 00:25:30,110
Right?

705
00:25:30,550 --> 00:25:31,310
Well...

706
00:25:31,680 --> 00:25:33,000
At least I have to

707
00:25:33,000 --> 00:25:35,000
look decent, right?

708
00:25:35,950 --> 00:25:37,350
You can't be like this!

709
00:25:37,350 --> 00:25:38,550
That definitely won't work,

710
00:25:38,550 --> 00:25:39,000
right?

711
00:25:42,140 --> 00:25:44,620
But actually,

712
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:49,110
do you know who my idol is?

713
00:25:52,750 --> 00:25:53,830
It's my dad.

714
00:25:55,510 --> 00:25:57,030
Do you remember when we were kids,

715
00:25:57,030 --> 00:25:58,430
when my dad was the chief?

716
00:25:59,000 --> 00:26:01,200
The way he managed the village...

717
00:26:01,550 --> 00:26:02,480
Every household

718
00:26:02,480 --> 00:26:04,070
was so happy, right?

719
00:26:04,590 --> 00:26:06,000
I just want to be like him.

720
00:26:06,000 --> 00:26:07,930
I want to take good care of everyone

721
00:26:08,240 --> 00:26:09,640
and benefit the village!

722
00:26:10,200 --> 00:26:11,350
Most importantly,

723
00:26:13,110 --> 00:26:14,200
a brother is like a father,

724
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:15,240
right?

725
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:16,310
I have to take good care of

726
00:26:16,310 --> 00:26:17,590
my sister.

727
00:26:17,590 --> 00:26:18,390
That's right.

728
00:26:18,880 --> 00:26:20,720
Bingqiang, I was right here.

729
00:26:20,720 --> 00:26:22,450
My sister and I were right here!

730
00:26:22,720 --> 00:26:23,350
And I told her

731
00:26:23,350 --> 00:26:25,400
I'd be the best brother in the world!

732
00:26:26,790 --> 00:26:27,680
I want to...

733
00:26:28,830 --> 00:26:30,920
She's been so tired.

734
00:26:31,350 --> 00:26:34,400
She's tried so hard

735
00:26:34,400 --> 00:26:37,200
to take care of me

736
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:38,510
in every possible way!

737
00:26:38,960 --> 00:26:40,550
I just want her to be a child!

738
00:26:40,830 --> 00:26:41,750
I thought that

739
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:42,980
if I became the chief,

740
00:26:42,980 --> 00:26:43,690
she'd see me

741
00:26:43,720 --> 00:26:44,880
differently and think,

742
00:26:44,880 --> 00:26:45,640
"He's the village chief now.

743
00:26:45,640 --> 00:26:46,790
I don't have to worry about him anymore."

744
00:26:46,790 --> 00:26:48,520
I just want her to rest assured.

745
00:26:48,680 --> 00:26:49,810
I want to prove to her

746
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:50,550
that I can

747
00:26:51,030 --> 00:26:52,000
make it on my own!

748
00:26:53,350 --> 00:26:54,030
Jiahao.

749
00:26:55,750 --> 00:26:57,000
What you just said...

750
00:26:57,960 --> 00:27:00,750
is absolutely right!

751
00:27:01,680 --> 00:27:02,720
Now,

752
00:27:03,980 --> 00:27:04,790
listen to me.

753
00:27:05,960 --> 00:27:08,020
You only need to accomplish one thing

754
00:27:08,880 --> 00:27:09,940
to prove yourself.

755
00:27:11,270 --> 00:27:13,480
And your sister and all the villagers

756
00:27:14,510 --> 00:27:16,480
will see you in a new light!

757
00:27:18,400 --> 00:27:19,400
Independent.

758
00:27:21,920 --> 00:27:23,480
Independent.

759
00:27:30,240 --> 00:27:33,440
I'll achieve something big!

760
00:27:33,700 --> 00:27:37,350
I'll achieve something big!

761
00:27:40,200 --> 00:27:42,960
Sally,

762
00:27:43,270 --> 00:27:44,480
where's the coffee I ordered?

763
00:27:44,480 --> 00:27:45,400
I'll order it right away.

764
00:27:45,400 --> 00:27:46,030
Right away?

765
00:27:46,030 --> 00:27:48,160
I said I wanted it half an hour ago,

766
00:27:48,200 --> 00:27:49,960
and you're ordering it now
and saying "right away"!

767
00:27:49,960 --> 00:27:51,310
If I want to drink it tomorrow,

768
00:27:51,310 --> 00:27:52,880
do I have to tell you now?

769
00:27:53,030 --> 00:27:53,890
Unbelievable.

770
00:27:54,310 --> 00:27:55,370
Did you shoot here?

771
00:27:55,640 --> 00:27:56,310
Okay.

772
00:27:56,720 --> 00:27:58,110
I don't like ice cubes!

773
00:27:58,110 --> 00:27:59,960
What about him? He doesn't want it?

774
00:27:59,960 --> 00:28:01,640
Hello, are you tourists?

775
00:28:04,840 --> 00:28:07,320
Excuse me, is Mr. Chen Hailong here?

776
00:28:08,430 --> 00:28:10,340
My father passed away many years ago.

777
00:28:10,340 --> 00:28:11,870
Why are you looking for him?

778
00:28:14,550 --> 00:28:15,480
My condolences.

779
00:28:17,920 --> 00:28:19,840
Chen Jiahao? Jiahao, right?

780
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:20,830
We know each other.

781
00:28:20,830 --> 00:28:21,830
We've met before.

782
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:22,880
I held you

783
00:28:23,350 --> 00:28:24,550
when you were little.

784
00:28:25,270 --> 00:28:26,960
I took a picture with your dad.

785
00:28:27,480 --> 00:28:27,880
Look.

786
00:28:28,830 --> 00:28:30,310
When I came here...

787
00:28:30,750 --> 00:28:31,480
That's my dad!

788
00:28:31,480 --> 00:28:32,010
Exactly.

789
00:28:32,720 --> 00:28:34,400
And the person next to him is you?

790
00:28:34,400 --> 00:28:35,270
Yes.

791
00:28:35,590 --> 00:28:37,160
W-Who are you?

792
00:28:38,590 --> 00:28:39,590
My name is Chris.

793
00:28:39,680 --> 00:28:40,270
Chris?

794
00:28:40,400 --> 00:28:41,590
Smile. Chris.

795
00:28:41,590 --> 00:28:42,040
Chris.

796
00:28:42,070 --> 00:28:43,870
Yes, you can also call me Kelesi.

797
00:28:44,070 --> 00:28:44,960
Kelesi.

798
00:28:45,310 --> 00:28:47,070
I'm Stephen Chow's agent

799
00:28:47,550 --> 00:28:48,750
and partner.

800
00:28:49,590 --> 00:28:51,030
Hey, keep shooting.

801
00:28:51,030 --> 00:28:52,260
You're Stephen Chow's agent?

802
00:28:52,260 --> 00:28:52,870
Yes.

803
00:28:53,030 --> 00:28:54,030
-Shoot here.
-Y-You...

804
00:28:54,030 --> 00:28:55,640
Please come in! Please come in!

805
00:28:55,640 --> 00:28:56,480
Go ahead.

806
00:28:56,480 --> 00:28:57,000
Okay.

807
00:28:57,310 --> 00:28:58,880
Well, look at this.

808
00:28:58,880 --> 00:28:59,830
It's based on

809
00:28:59,830 --> 00:29:02,070
Mr. Stephen Chow's movie,

810
00:29:02,070 --> 00:29:02,960
King of Comedy,

811
00:29:03,250 --> 00:29:04,200
a one-to-one replica...

812
00:29:04,200 --> 00:29:05,280
I can see that.

813
00:29:05,300 --> 00:29:05,830
Yes.

814
00:29:05,860 --> 00:29:06,460
That's right.

815
00:29:06,460 --> 00:29:07,790
I'm the...

816
00:29:08,440 --> 00:29:09,350
acting village chief.

817
00:29:09,350 --> 00:29:10,750
What can I do for you?

818
00:29:11,240 --> 00:29:12,100
Village chief?

819
00:29:12,960 --> 00:29:14,480
Just like your father?

820
00:29:15,240 --> 00:29:16,200
-Great.
-Yes. Yes.

821
00:29:16,200 --> 00:29:18,350
Actually, it was Stephen Chow
who sent me here this time.

822
00:29:18,350 --> 00:29:20,790
He wants to make "New King of Comedy,"

823
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:22,980
hoping he can
cooperate with the villagers.

824
00:29:22,980 --> 00:29:24,400
My team is outside.

825
00:29:25,350 --> 00:29:26,880
The camera crew, art department,

826
00:29:26,880 --> 00:29:28,410
and producers are all here.

827
00:29:28,870 --> 00:29:30,590
Well, just talk to me!

828
00:29:30,610 --> 00:29:31,830
I'm the acting chief!

829
00:29:31,880 --> 00:29:33,280
Here, Bingqiang. Hurry!

830
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:34,160
What's going on?

831
00:29:34,160 --> 00:29:35,620
This is Mr. Stephen Chow's...

832
00:29:35,620 --> 00:29:37,050
agent!

833
00:29:37,110 --> 00:29:37,720
Agent?

834
00:29:37,720 --> 00:29:39,310
They want to shoot a movie here.

835
00:29:39,310 --> 00:29:40,960
Hello, I'm Chen Bingqiang.

836
00:29:41,240 --> 00:29:41,680
Chris.

837
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:42,310
Chris?

838
00:29:42,680 --> 00:29:43,110
Smile.

839
00:29:43,950 --> 00:29:44,790
-Chris.
-Chris.

840
00:29:44,790 --> 00:29:46,050
You can call me Kelesi.

841
00:29:46,160 --> 00:29:46,680
Hello.

842
00:29:46,890 --> 00:29:48,370
They're shooting a movie.

843
00:29:49,110 --> 00:29:51,400
Excuse me, may I ask a question?

844
00:29:51,400 --> 00:29:52,530
This is happening so fast.

845
00:29:52,530 --> 00:29:53,640
Why did Mr. Stephen Chow

846
00:29:53,640 --> 00:29:56,300
suddenly decide
to shoot a movie in our village?

847
00:29:56,570 --> 00:29:59,460
Actually, you know,
it's hard for common people like us

848
00:29:59,460 --> 00:30:01,740
to understand a genius like Master Chow.

849
00:30:01,940 --> 00:30:04,070
He's been considering making a movie about

850
00:30:04,070 --> 00:30:05,150
women's soccer these years.

851
00:30:05,150 --> 00:30:05,550
Yes.

852
00:30:05,550 --> 00:30:07,000
Year after year.

853
00:30:07,310 --> 00:30:08,590
But after seeing your video,

854
00:30:08,590 --> 00:30:10,200
he said he didn't want to do that anymore.

855
00:30:10,200 --> 00:30:10,920
He wanted to do "yours."

856
00:30:10,920 --> 00:30:11,680
-That's right.
-Do "ours"?

857
00:30:11,680 --> 00:30:13,030
That was infringement,

858
00:30:13,030 --> 00:30:14,400
but now he loves it.

859
00:30:16,610 --> 00:30:17,940
No discord, no concord.

860
00:30:18,350 --> 00:30:19,350
Sounds like his style.

861
00:30:19,350 --> 00:30:19,750
Right?

862
00:30:20,350 --> 00:30:20,830
Excuse me,

863
00:30:20,830 --> 00:30:21,590
I have another small question

864
00:30:21,590 --> 00:30:22,720
to ask...

865
00:30:25,070 --> 00:30:26,000
Perfect timing.

866
00:30:26,440 --> 00:30:27,370
Hello, Mr. Chow.

867
00:30:27,590 --> 00:30:28,120
How is it?

868
00:30:28,590 --> 00:30:30,520
Yes, this is the place. Take a look!

869
00:30:31,110 --> 00:30:32,970
The ping-pong tables are all set.

870
00:30:33,200 --> 00:30:35,270
Props and sets are ready.

871
00:30:35,510 --> 00:30:36,790
Is this the scene for "you support me"?

872
00:30:36,790 --> 00:30:37,790
You support me?

873
00:30:38,160 --> 00:30:39,030
I'll support you.

874
00:30:39,030 --> 00:30:40,920
I'll support you after this project!

875
00:30:40,920 --> 00:30:41,310
Okay.

876
00:30:41,310 --> 00:30:42,480
Okay, bye.

877
00:30:43,580 --> 00:30:44,680
Did you see that?

878
00:30:44,680 --> 00:30:46,680
Master Chow loves

879
00:30:46,710 --> 00:30:47,400
this place.

880
00:30:47,640 --> 00:30:48,510
So, I hope

881
00:30:48,720 --> 00:30:49,880
we can work together.

882
00:30:49,880 --> 00:30:50,590
N-No problem!

883
00:30:50,590 --> 00:30:51,790
I'm the acting chief,

884
00:30:51,790 --> 00:30:52,950
but I'm just like the real one!

885
00:30:52,950 --> 00:30:53,830
Do you have the final say?

886
00:30:53,830 --> 00:30:54,960
Can you decide this?

887
00:30:55,070 --> 00:30:56,200
Why can't I?

888
00:30:56,200 --> 00:30:56,940
I don't think you can.

889
00:30:56,940 --> 00:30:58,270
-I'm...
-No, you can't.

890
00:30:58,670 --> 00:31:00,080
W-What do you mean?

891
00:31:00,110 --> 00:31:01,630
Sorry, we...

892
00:31:02,910 --> 00:31:04,030
This is too important

893
00:31:04,030 --> 00:31:05,310
and sudden.

894
00:31:05,310 --> 00:31:06,960
We'd like to discuss it
with the villagers.

895
00:31:06,960 --> 00:31:07,790
Do you mind?

896
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:12,240
Discuss? No problem.

897
00:31:12,370 --> 00:31:13,370
Very reasonable.

898
00:31:13,950 --> 00:31:16,580
I happen to be staying nearby
these few days.

899
00:31:17,960 --> 00:31:19,020
This business card

900
00:31:19,720 --> 00:31:20,720
is not just a card.

901
00:31:20,920 --> 00:31:22,520
It's a token of my sincerity.

902
00:31:23,720 --> 00:31:24,050
Okay.

903
00:31:25,590 --> 00:31:27,250
You really look like your dad.

904
00:31:29,000 --> 00:31:30,110
I'll be waiting for your reply.

905
00:31:30,110 --> 00:31:30,590
-Okay.
-Okay.

906
00:31:30,590 --> 00:31:31,400
-See you.
-See you.

907
00:31:31,400 --> 00:31:32,400
Goodbye, sir!

908
00:31:32,400 --> 00:31:33,070
Goodbye.

909
00:31:34,320 --> 00:31:35,560
Where's my coffee?

910
00:31:35,580 --> 00:31:36,770
Sally?

911
00:31:36,800 --> 00:31:38,000
Stephen Chow!

912
00:31:38,790 --> 00:31:40,200
Stephen Chow!

913
00:31:41,790 --> 00:31:42,310
Well, why...

914
00:31:42,310 --> 00:31:43,830
why did you stop me?

915
00:31:43,830 --> 00:31:44,440
I... I...

916
00:31:44,440 --> 00:31:46,240
Why wouldn't you let me call him?

917
00:31:46,640 --> 00:31:47,920
You can't be too careful.

918
00:31:47,920 --> 00:31:48,480
Why would such a big project

919
00:31:48,480 --> 00:31:49,720
fall right into our hands?

920
00:31:49,720 --> 00:31:50,680
What if he's a scammer?

921
00:31:50,680 --> 00:31:52,750
Why can't it be real?

922
00:31:53,830 --> 00:31:56,030
I-I even saw his face!

923
00:31:56,030 --> 00:31:56,720
I've never been this close to Master Zhou

924
00:31:56,720 --> 00:31:57,750
my entire life!

925
00:31:57,750 --> 00:31:58,810
Why can't it be him?

926
00:31:59,000 --> 00:32:00,310
Haven't you heard of AI?

927
00:32:00,310 --> 00:32:01,150
What AI?

928
00:32:02,510 --> 00:32:03,800
Did you find anything?

929
00:32:08,550 --> 00:32:09,110
Yes!

930
00:32:09,110 --> 00:32:09,960
That's him!

931
00:32:09,960 --> 00:32:10,510
Wait...

932
00:32:10,640 --> 00:32:11,200
That's him! Look!

933
00:32:11,200 --> 00:32:12,480
He looks thinner in the picture
than in person.

934
00:32:12,480 --> 00:32:13,410
Yes, that's him!

935
00:32:13,750 --> 00:32:14,720
Look, isn't it written here?

936
00:32:14,720 --> 00:32:16,510
"New King of Comedy."

937
00:32:16,920 --> 00:32:17,790
This is it!

938
00:32:17,790 --> 00:32:18,680
Company...

939
00:32:19,200 --> 00:32:21,790
Starlight Overseas Co., Ltd.

940
00:32:22,680 --> 00:32:23,340
It matches!

941
00:32:24,030 --> 00:32:25,640
You really hit the jackpot!

942
00:32:25,640 --> 00:32:26,160
Right?

943
00:32:26,620 --> 00:32:27,580
Oh my god!

944
00:32:27,610 --> 00:32:28,870
If we get this project,

945
00:32:29,130 --> 00:32:31,360
you'll be the greatest hero
in Shapu Village!

946
00:32:31,360 --> 00:32:31,790
Me?

947
00:32:32,110 --> 00:32:34,200
You deserve to be the village chief!

948
00:32:35,080 --> 00:32:35,660
Wonderful!

949
00:32:35,660 --> 00:32:36,830
I'll contact him right away.

950
00:32:36,830 --> 00:32:38,030
Come on, give it to me.

951
00:32:38,220 --> 00:32:38,940
Wait.

952
00:32:39,460 --> 00:32:42,790
Shouldn't you ask Zhen first?

953
00:32:42,970 --> 00:32:44,030
You can't make such a big decision

954
00:32:44,030 --> 00:32:45,350
all by yourself.

955
00:32:45,370 --> 00:32:46,110
Ask Zhen first.

956
00:32:46,110 --> 00:32:46,830
Call Zhen.

957
00:32:47,070 --> 00:32:48,030
N-No need.

958
00:32:48,160 --> 00:32:49,480
I can make the final call.

959
00:32:49,480 --> 00:32:50,510
Besides, this is a good thing.

960
00:32:50,510 --> 00:32:51,510
Why would she stop me?

961
00:32:51,510 --> 00:32:53,030
If she doesn't believe it
and checks again,

962
00:32:53,030 --> 00:32:54,110
it'll be too late.

963
00:32:54,160 --> 00:32:55,160
I'll call him.

964
00:32:57,070 --> 00:32:57,830
Hurry up.

965
00:33:01,980 --> 00:33:02,830
Hello?

966
00:33:10,920 --> 00:33:12,480
This is so luxurious...

967
00:33:13,110 --> 00:33:15,030
You are an acting village chief after all.

968
00:33:15,030 --> 00:33:16,160
Calm down.

969
00:33:16,160 --> 00:33:17,890
Don't act like an ignorant kid.

970
00:33:19,160 --> 00:33:19,890
He's coming.

971
00:33:20,720 --> 00:33:22,110
How are you two doing?

972
00:33:29,160 --> 00:33:29,790
Have some tea.

973
00:33:29,790 --> 00:33:30,400
Thank you.

974
00:33:30,400 --> 00:33:32,350
Just make yourselves at home.

975
00:33:39,200 --> 00:33:41,580
I can tell this is white tea.

976
00:33:42,440 --> 00:33:44,660
You know, there's a saying
about white tea.

977
00:33:44,660 --> 00:33:46,800
"One year, it's tea;

978
00:33:46,830 --> 00:33:48,430
three years, it's medicine;

979
00:33:48,560 --> 00:33:50,120
seven years, it's a treasure."

980
00:33:50,120 --> 00:33:52,120
I just took a sip, and I knew

981
00:33:52,790 --> 00:33:53,790
this tea must be

982
00:33:54,260 --> 00:33:56,370
at least seven or eight years old.

983
00:33:56,560 --> 00:33:57,710
It's a treasure.

984
00:33:58,230 --> 00:33:59,080
To be honest,

985
00:33:59,100 --> 00:34:00,730
I don't know much about tea.

986
00:34:01,030 --> 00:34:03,090
I made it with a tea bag from the hotel.

987
00:34:04,670 --> 00:34:06,560
It's indeed a grand hotel.

988
00:34:06,590 --> 00:34:08,670
Even the tea bags are antiques.

989
00:34:08,670 --> 00:34:09,760
Well...

990
00:34:09,760 --> 00:34:10,590
Talk less.

991
00:34:10,690 --> 00:34:13,570
You're not here to talk about

992
00:34:13,800 --> 00:34:15,150
tea bags,

993
00:34:15,440 --> 00:34:15,840
right?

994
00:34:16,230 --> 00:34:16,920
Well,

995
00:34:18,840 --> 00:34:19,440
Mr. Kele.

996
00:34:19,670 --> 00:34:20,360
Smile.

997
00:34:21,460 --> 00:34:22,179
Mr. Kele.

998
00:34:23,000 --> 00:34:25,449
After our discussion,

999
00:34:25,480 --> 00:34:26,840
we all agree

1000
00:34:27,110 --> 00:34:28,110
and fully support

1001
00:34:28,400 --> 00:34:30,150
Master Chow coming to Shapu Village

1002
00:34:30,150 --> 00:34:31,810
to shoot "New King of Comedy."

1003
00:34:33,400 --> 00:34:34,199
That's great.

1004
00:34:35,150 --> 00:34:37,000
I thank you on behalf of Mr. Chow.

1005
00:34:38,550 --> 00:34:39,710
I'm so happy

1006
00:34:39,710 --> 00:34:40,800
that master Chow can finally fulfill

1007
00:34:40,800 --> 00:34:42,800
his wish in Shapu Village.

1008
00:34:43,760 --> 00:34:45,670
I believe my dad would also be happy

1009
00:34:45,670 --> 00:34:46,800
if he could see this.

1010
00:34:47,489 --> 00:34:49,250
Mr. Chris, I have a small question.

1011
00:34:49,250 --> 00:34:51,889
I wonder when Mr. Stephen Chow

1012
00:34:52,280 --> 00:34:53,810
will come to Shapu Village.

1013
00:34:54,550 --> 00:34:56,360
When is he coming?

1014
00:34:59,280 --> 00:35:00,000
Alright.

1015
00:35:00,230 --> 00:35:01,560
I'll be honest with you.

1016
00:35:01,640 --> 00:35:03,150
We're friends now after all.

1017
00:35:03,150 --> 00:35:03,550
Yes.

1018
00:35:04,070 --> 00:35:06,280
Actually, Master Chow

1019
00:35:07,030 --> 00:35:09,230
in the private room upstairs right now.

1020
00:35:12,230 --> 00:35:15,550
M-Master Chow is here?

1021
00:35:15,550 --> 00:35:18,350
He's having a meeting
with a very important guest.

1022
00:35:19,010 --> 00:35:20,420
Do you want to take a look?

1023
00:35:20,670 --> 00:35:21,800
I-Is it convenient?

1024
00:35:21,800 --> 00:35:22,600
Can we see him?

1025
00:35:23,800 --> 00:35:24,840
Follow Chris.

1026
00:35:38,630 --> 00:35:41,150
Master Chow is having a meeting
with a very important guest.

1027
00:35:41,150 --> 00:35:42,240
Do not disturb him,

1028
00:35:42,760 --> 00:35:43,320
understand?

1029
00:35:43,320 --> 00:35:44,840
-Got it.
-That's right.

1030
00:35:44,840 --> 00:35:45,590
Calm down.

1031
00:35:45,590 --> 00:35:46,030
Okay.

1032
00:35:46,030 --> 00:35:46,880
-Calm down.
-Okay.

1033
00:35:46,880 --> 00:35:47,920
I saw Master Chow!

1034
00:35:47,980 --> 00:35:49,150
This must be real!

1035
00:35:49,150 --> 00:35:51,000
I-I was being petty before.

1036
00:35:52,660 --> 00:35:53,140
Sir,

1037
00:35:53,400 --> 00:35:55,510
who are those people eating with

1038
00:35:55,510 --> 00:35:56,770
Master Chow upstairs?

1039
00:35:56,800 --> 00:35:57,840
They're a big deal.

1040
00:35:57,840 --> 00:36:00,710
They're all investors
of "New King of Comedy."

1041
00:36:01,410 --> 00:36:02,380
Investors?

1042
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:04,430
Investing in New King of Comedy's movies

1043
00:36:04,430 --> 00:36:06,230
must be very profitable, right?

1044
00:36:07,630 --> 00:36:08,630
What do you think?

1045
00:36:09,000 --> 00:36:09,800
That's right.

1046
00:36:09,920 --> 00:36:10,920
Always profitable.

1047
00:36:10,920 --> 00:36:11,720
Right.

1048
00:36:12,990 --> 00:36:13,800
Currently,

1049
00:36:13,820 --> 00:36:16,550
we estimate the box office
for this movie to be...

1050
00:36:18,880 --> 00:36:19,840
300,000 yuan?

1051
00:36:19,870 --> 00:36:21,370
Wouldn't 300,000 be a loss?

1052
00:36:21,370 --> 00:36:22,770
-300,000?
-300 million.

1053
00:36:23,070 --> 00:36:23,800
Definitely 300 million.

1054
00:36:23,800 --> 00:36:24,550
3...

1055
00:36:24,840 --> 00:36:26,590
No, 3 billion.

1056
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:30,360
3... 3 billion?

1057
00:36:32,030 --> 00:36:33,710
-One movie can make 3 billion yuan?
-Master Chow.

1058
00:36:33,710 --> 00:36:35,170
It's Master Chow's movie.

1059
00:36:36,710 --> 00:36:37,840
Master Chow's movie.

1060
00:36:37,840 --> 00:36:38,900
Speaking of which,

1061
00:36:39,320 --> 00:36:40,650
I actually have an idea.

1062
00:36:40,760 --> 00:36:43,800
First, it's Master Chow's affection
for the village.

1063
00:36:44,510 --> 00:36:47,640
Second, it's the friendship
between your father and me.

1064
00:36:48,590 --> 00:36:50,000
I really want you to join us,

1065
00:36:50,000 --> 00:36:51,060
invest some money,

1066
00:36:51,510 --> 00:36:53,110
and make a fortune together.

1067
00:36:53,280 --> 00:36:54,030
M-Me?

1068
00:36:57,320 --> 00:36:57,920
I-I can...

1069
00:36:59,320 --> 00:37:00,150
Thank you, sir!

1070
00:37:00,150 --> 00:37:01,240
Thank you, Mr. Kele!

1071
00:37:01,240 --> 00:37:01,920
You're welcome.

1072
00:37:01,920 --> 00:37:03,550
H-How much do I need to invest?

1073
00:37:03,550 --> 00:37:05,920
Tens of thousands, hundreds of thousands,
it doesn't matter.

1074
00:37:05,920 --> 00:37:07,050
The more you invest,

1075
00:37:07,230 --> 00:37:08,110
the more you earn.

1076
00:37:08,110 --> 00:37:09,090
I-I get it.

1077
00:37:11,400 --> 00:37:12,550
Well, then...

1078
00:37:12,800 --> 00:37:15,060
can I ask the villagers to invest with me?

1079
00:37:16,630 --> 00:37:17,630
Well...

1080
00:37:18,550 --> 00:37:21,710
This might be a bit difficult.

1081
00:37:22,920 --> 00:37:24,180
Sir, here's the thing.

1082
00:37:24,320 --> 00:37:25,590
I've always had a dream since childhood.

1083
00:37:25,590 --> 00:37:26,480
I hope I can

1084
00:37:26,480 --> 00:37:28,360
lead the village to prosperity.

1085
00:37:28,630 --> 00:37:30,400
Now there's a great opportunity.

1086
00:37:30,400 --> 00:37:32,070
Can I bring them along?

1087
00:37:32,920 --> 00:37:33,650
Listen to me.

1088
00:37:33,840 --> 00:37:34,920
It's mainly because

1089
00:37:34,920 --> 00:37:36,280
we've never done

1090
00:37:36,280 --> 00:37:37,710
such things before.

1091
00:37:38,480 --> 00:37:40,610
I don't know if Master Chow will agree.

1092
00:37:41,630 --> 00:37:43,230
Well, sir...

1093
00:37:43,230 --> 00:37:45,030
aren't you his agent?

1094
00:37:45,030 --> 00:37:46,000
If you talk to him,

1095
00:37:46,000 --> 00:37:47,190
he'll definitely agree.

1096
00:37:47,190 --> 00:37:48,720
He'll listen to you, right?

1097
00:37:51,480 --> 00:37:52,590
Sir, how about this?

1098
00:37:52,590 --> 00:37:54,360
For my father's sake,

1099
00:37:54,450 --> 00:37:55,940
please help me out, okay?

1100
00:37:59,190 --> 00:38:00,670
You really look like him.

1101
00:38:02,280 --> 00:38:03,280
Look at your lips.

1102
00:38:05,360 --> 00:38:06,880
Fine, you've got my word.

1103
00:38:07,250 --> 00:38:08,050
I'll help you.

1104
00:38:08,710 --> 00:38:09,480
Thank you, sir!

1105
00:38:09,480 --> 00:38:10,230
Thank you, sir!

1106
00:38:10,230 --> 00:38:10,960
I...

1107
00:38:11,550 --> 00:38:12,410
Thank you, sir!

1108
00:38:13,400 --> 00:38:14,590
Come here. Come here.

1109
00:38:14,590 --> 00:38:15,840
Let's make money together, okay?

1110
00:38:15,840 --> 00:38:16,760
-Okay!
-Make money together!

1111
00:38:16,760 --> 00:38:21,440
-Make money together!
-Make money together!

1112
00:38:31,320 --> 00:38:33,250
It's not entirely Jiahao's fault.

1113
00:38:34,030 --> 00:38:36,160
This scammer used all kinds of tricks.

1114
00:38:36,230 --> 00:38:37,690
He must've been prepared.

1115
00:38:38,440 --> 00:38:39,900
And Jiahao is so innocent.

1116
00:38:41,110 --> 00:38:42,590
He came to the village.

1117
00:38:44,190 --> 00:38:45,450
But you were right beside him.

1118
00:38:45,450 --> 00:38:46,590
Why didn't you remind him?

1119
00:38:46,590 --> 00:38:47,720
It's such a big deal.

1120
00:38:48,070 --> 00:38:50,440
I did, but he wouldn't listen to us.

1121
00:38:50,590 --> 00:38:54,590
One, two, three, four, five...

1122
00:38:56,240 --> 00:38:57,770
Where did you get the money?

1123
00:38:58,760 --> 00:39:00,620
It's the dividend from the movie.

1124
00:39:02,070 --> 00:39:03,550
Isn't it a bit strange

1125
00:39:03,550 --> 00:39:06,280
that they're giving you
dividends at this point?

1126
00:39:06,590 --> 00:39:08,230
Ximei, I wanted to ask you.

1127
00:39:08,320 --> 00:39:10,360
Was there something wrong
with your previous projects?

1128
00:39:10,360 --> 00:39:12,960
Maybe all Master Chow's movies
work like this.

1129
00:39:14,230 --> 00:39:16,230
Wait, I still feel it's a bit weird.

1130
00:39:16,490 --> 00:39:17,110
How about...

1131
00:39:17,110 --> 00:39:17,840
Ximei...

1132
00:39:18,150 --> 00:39:20,110
Are you trying to take my sister's place?

1133
00:39:20,110 --> 00:39:21,230
I was just about to say this.

1134
00:39:21,230 --> 00:39:23,190
How about we call Zhen first?

1135
00:39:26,590 --> 00:39:28,520
I always ask her when I spend money,

1136
00:39:28,590 --> 00:39:30,850
and now I have to ask her
when I make money?

1137
00:39:31,070 --> 00:39:31,960
Ridiculous.

1138
00:39:33,070 --> 00:39:35,110
Well, Jiahao, I...

1139
00:39:36,280 --> 00:39:37,800
Say something!

1140
00:39:42,590 --> 00:39:45,670
Well, the money is real.

1141
00:39:46,550 --> 00:39:50,280
I think... it's fine.

1142
00:39:53,630 --> 00:39:55,510
Wait, where are you going?

1143
00:39:55,960 --> 00:39:57,440
I have good news for you.

1144
00:39:57,480 --> 00:40:00,200
We received a large amount of
advertising sponsorship,

1145
00:40:00,200 --> 00:40:01,880
so we can give you dividends in advance.

1146
00:40:01,880 --> 00:40:03,820
There's more good news.

1147
00:40:03,840 --> 00:40:06,280
An investor temporarily
withdrew their funds,

1148
00:40:06,280 --> 00:40:08,110
so this share of 1.5 million yuan

1149
00:40:08,110 --> 00:40:10,000
can be given to you.

1150
00:40:10,150 --> 00:40:13,000
Another piece of good news!

1151
00:40:13,440 --> 00:40:17,000
Mr. Stephen Chow is coming to
Shapu Village in person!

1152
00:40:23,840 --> 00:40:26,030
I just wanted to prove myself.

